SUMMARY:Deadline: The Stringer Awards 2027 (independent accountability jour
 nalism)
DESCRIPTION:The Stringer Awards give unrestricted\, multi-year funding to i
 ndependent journalists who expose abuses of power\, in Senior and Emerging
  categories. No nationality restriction is stated. No application fee.\n\n
 Organisation: Stringer Journalism Foundation\nLocation: Remote. Open to in
 dependent journalists internationally.\nAward: USD 9\,000 to 100\,000 per 
 award\, multi-year and unrestricted\; the size depends on funds raised.\nD
 uration: Multi-year unrestricted award.\n\nMore: https://stringerjournalis
 m.org/awards?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://stringerjournalism.org/awards?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrant
 desk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Remote. Open to independent journalists internationally.
